{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣啦啦隊韓籍女神李多慧，到台發展超過3年，憑藉甜美笑容及親民魅力累積大批粉絲，社交平台人氣持續上升。</p><p>近日李多慧公開招募「頻道內容企劃」，開出月薪5萬至7萬元新台幣（約11,900至16,600港元），除了年終獎金最高3個月，還有機票補貼、</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T18:24:21.380993+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T18:01:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T18:17:33.901097+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T18:17:33.901097+00:00","content_hash":"58a2648bd0ab7cbe53a2209ab5c57d427a158a42dd462527a3f6bedfc181b6a7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}